  "reasoning": "The defendant operated an arcade and installed three electronic fishing machines that have gambling functions, providing a venue and equipment for gambling. This constitutes the crime of establishing a casino (providing gambling venue and tools). He was caught and voluntarily surrendered, but the act itself fulfills the elements of the crime of opening a casino under Chinese criminal law. No other distinct crimes are indicated in the facts.",
